<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!-- Production traffic uses HTTPS. Local networking remains enabled for the
	     Vite development server without allowing arbitrary cleartext internet traffic. -->
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSAllowsLocalNetworking</key>
		<true/>
	</dict>
	<!-- Voice input: the composer's mic button records audio and transcribes it. macOS CRASHES the
	     app if it accesses the mic / speech recognition without these usage strings present. -->
	<key>NSAppleEventsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Mr. Day One 需要控制其他应用来替你完成桌面自动化任务（打开应用、切换窗口、点击菜单、读取界面）。</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Michael IDE 用麦克风做语音输入——把你说的话转成文字填进 AI 对话框。</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Michael IDE 用语音识别把你的语音转写成文字。</string>
	<!-- Nearby discovery only requests location after the user asks for the
	     current area. It is never inferred from IP address or timezone. -->
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Michael IDE 仅在你要求查询当前位置附近内容时使用位置，用于查找周边餐饮、景点和天气。</string>
	<key>NSLocationUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Michael IDE 仅在你明确请求时使用当前位置提供附近地点信息。</string>
</dict>
</plist>
